The goal of this mission is to reach the Spire found at the end of each of the 3 Promyvion zones and defeat all 3 of the bosses in the "Ancient Flames Beckon" battlefields. Defeating each boss gives a key item. Once you have all 3 key items the mission is completed, and the next mission starts.
>**__With the lifting of the level cap in Promathia areas, this quest is now relatively trivial in difficulty. The walkthrough below was written for a level cap of 30.**__
* **Trusts may be called through the entire climb and Spire fight**, making it possible to solo this at 40 or even earlier.
** **NOTE**: when you reach the Spire, do __not__ summon your trusts until you pass through the barrier into the boss arena or they will be dismissed and you will have to wait on the recast timer to re-summon them.

>**__Be aware that there are new, high-level {p:Apex|Category:Apex Monster} enemies ranging from level 139 to 142 in these areas. They may be avoided by taking alternate paths around them, see the {p:Apex|Category:Apex Monster} page for maps which show the locations of these dangerous enemies.**__
* Do make sure to avoid any Apex Mobs as those will {p:aggro|Aggro} with {@a:True Sound|Detects by True Sound} True Sound detection and require multiple endgame players to fight.

\**Note**: Your mission log won't change to "The Mothercrystals" until clearing one of the Promyvion areas. Since the walkthrough for all 3 Promyvions are similar, they are all included in this section.
=2 Walkthrough
