=2 Plot Details
* {p:The Empty|Category:Empty}
** Empty are the remnants of creatures absorbed by the emptiness. Some of these creatures are region specific.
*** {p:Craver}: Exclusive to Mea, with the gait of a {p:Dhalmel|Category:Dhalmel} and the long legs and tail of a {p:Coeurl|Category:Coeurl}.
*** {p:Thinker}: Exclusive to Holla, a region resembling {z:La Theine Plateau} / {z:Ordelle's Caves} with {m:Crabs|Crab}, {p:Morbols|Morbol}, and {m:Walking Trees|Walking Tree}.
*** {p:Gorger}: Exclusive to Dem, a region that may draw from places similar to {z:Konschtat Highlands} and {z:Gusgen Mines}.
** The Empty have an elemental core, based on their last memories. The Empty hunger for memories, and even feed from other Empty.
*** The color of their core matches the memory item they drop, and the element of their {p:Promyvion Brume|Category:Craver} and {p:Memory of \_\_\_\_|Category:Weeper}.
** {p:Wanderer and Weeper (Official Site)|http://www.playonline.com/ff11us/promathia/enemies/enemies_01.html}

